    "title": "5-Year-Old Hit by Fleeing Driver in West Price Hill, Rushed to Hospital - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Avery Bennett ,\n10 hours ago\nCincinnati Children’s Medical Center — Hospital Mentioned In Earlier Incidents. A 5-year-old was struck by a vehicle that fled the scene in Cincinnati's West Price Hill neighborhood Thursday morning, sending the child to the hospital and leaving police with few answers so far. Cincinnati police and fire crews responded just after 8 a.m. to the 1000 block of Seton Avenue after reports that the child had been hit.\nRead full article",
